    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations, this stunning A-rated three-bedroom ground floor apartment offers a superb combination of contemporary design, energy efficiency, and unrivalled convenience. \n\nPositioned in the heart of Mount Merrion, residents enjoy immediate access to an array of local amenities while benefiting from excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\nPresented in turnkey condition, this beautifully appointed home extends to a generous and thoughtfully designed layout, perfectly suited to modern living.\n\nUpon entering, a welcoming hallway leads to an impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area flooded with natural light. The sleek, fully fitted contemporary kitchen seamlessly integrates with the bright living space, while large glazed doors open directly onto a magnificent private terrace, creating an ideal setting for al fresco dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing outdoors.\n\nThe accommodation comprises three spacious double bedrooms, all finished to an exceptional standard. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish ensuite bathroom, while a luxurious main bathroom features both a full-sized bath and shower. Practicality is further enhanced by a large walk-in cloakroom and a separate linen room complete with built-in shelving, providing superb storage throughout.\n\nThis outstanding apartment also benefits from a designated parking space together with an extra-large storage unit located in the secure underground parking area.\n\nThe location is second to none. A short stroll brings you to the charming shops and amenities of The Rise, while nearby Blackrock and Stillorgan Villages offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, and shopping centres. UCD, St. Vincent's University Hospital and numerous business hubs are all within easy reach, while excellent public transport links provide direct access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWide open hallway with wood flooring, large cloakroom with ample storage.\n\nLiving / Kitchen - 5.14m x 8.41m\nBright open plan living/dining and kitchen. Double doors to enter, modern kitchen with floor and wall hung units. Stainless steel sink, under unit lighting, large South facing window, integrated appliances to include a Zanussi oven, microwave, dishwasher and washer dryer. Large dining area for family size table and chairs, leading to open plan living area with double galss doors flooding the room with South facing light and leading to a large terrace.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.95m x 5.80m\nSpacious double bedroom with wood flooring, built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite Shower Room - \nEn suite with floor to ceiling tiling, walk in shower, wash hand basin with storage, heated towel rail, WC.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.47m x 4.46m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring, built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.14m x 2.80m\nSpacious double bedroom, located beside the main bathroom, wood flooring, built in wardrobes, large window overlooking terrace.\n\nBathroom - 1.95m x 2.51m\nLarge family size bathroom with floor to ceiling tiling, walk in shower, wash hand basin with storage, WC, heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> A-rated energy-efficient apartment</li><li> Exceptional three-bedroom ground floor residence</li><li> Large private terrace accessed through glazed doors</li><li> Designated parking space.</li><li> Extra-large storage unit in secure underground parking</li><li> Short walk to shops and amenities at The Rise</li><li> Close to UCD and St. Vincent's University Hospital</li><li> Minutes from Blackrock and Stillorgan Villages</li><li> Excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre</li><li> Presented in superb turnkey condition.</ul>"
      },
